                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <p>MIAX® operates four U.S. options exchanges with technology, pricing models and trading protocols designed to support the unique demands of U.S. derivatives markets.</p>
                                      

<div class="card card-mini">
  <div class="card-body">
          <h5 class="card-title">MIAX Options®</h5>
        <p class="card-text">A pro-rata allocation model rewards market makers for providing continuous two-sided quotes.</p>
  </div>
</div>
                                      

<div class="card card-mini">
  <div class="card-body">
          <h5 class="card-title">MIAX Pearl®</h5>
        <p class="card-text">A price-time priority allocation model with maker-taker pricing encourages liquidity-seeking strategies.</p>
  </div>
</div>
                                      

<div class="card card-mini">
  <div class="card-body">
          <h5 class="card-title">MIAX Emerald®</h5>
        <p class="card-text">A pro-rata allocation model with maker-taker pricing encourages large bid-offer quantities and liquidity-seeking strategies.</p>
  </div>
</div>
                                      

<div class="card card-mini">
  <div class="card-body">
          <h5 class="card-title">MIAX Sapphire®</h5>
        <p class="card-text">A price-time allocation model with taker-maker pricing, and a state-of-the-art open outcry trading floor in Miami.</p>
  </div>
</div>
                                  </div>
              </div>
